rovano a condividere lo stesso tetto per trenta giorni, Travis dimostra un’inaspettata mistura di dolcezza e passionalità. Solo lui è in grado di leggere fino in fondo all’anima tormentata di Abby e capire cosa si nasconde dietro i suoi silenzi. Ma Abby ha troppa paura di affidargli la chiave per il suo ultimo e più profondo segreto…","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2023-04-04","status":"Released","rating":6.628,"ratingCount":926,"genres":["Romance","Dramma","Commedia"],"countries":["United States of America"],"facts":{"Runtime":"96m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":95686,"name":"Dylan Sprouse","role":"Travis Maddox","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gpfMji2v7BXtovSptxTkrk88s89.jpg"},{"id":1279279,"name":"Virginia Gardner","role":"Abby Abernathy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/53BsLl54uesFOa2DBraibwtRdEL.jpg"},{"id":1449393,"name":"Austin North","role":"Shepley Maddox","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AuamGbm12flhZ0K95hhdyhYAbBS.jpg"},{"id":1524899,"name":"Libe Barer","role":"America Mason","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/peA4FQ9y8vImDrjEPrq6XlqYY5P.jpg"},{"id":20960,"name":"Rob Estes","role":"Benny","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uRex9dyCv4mt7V4mxUzZ9NmVxjH.jpg"},{"id":19148,"name":"Brian Austin Green","role":"Mick Abernathy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8KGhmSEmxwn6oJBN5NCpeYDJ2hx.jpg"},{"id":74607,"name":"Autumn Reeser","role":"Professor Felder","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ftDOWocmtT9YSZhV6bVrbsywIad.jpg"},{"id":1224112,"name":"Samuel Larsen","role":"Jesse Viveros","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a9AQOsvl0IUHe23sz7wYsgHFBn4.jpg"},{"id":212236,"name":"Manal El-Feitury","role":"Bursa","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zRs4USVkkKInhI1ZRcrkuKIfAM3.jpg"},{"id":3888806,"name":"Jack Hesketh","role":"Trenton Maddox","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qTuXX750tfsMa2uKG7KHyYt2Szy.jpg"},{"id":32